  "description": "Lee Ryu-Jin, a writer struggling with a slump, stumbles into a relationship with his fan and gangster, \"Second.\" The writer, desperate to overcome his slump, and the gangster, eager to learn how to write, form a bond of necessity. Through this exchange, the two gradually change, but \"Second\"'s world refuses to leave him alone...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
